From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tanjilbhuiyan <tanjilbhuiyan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:32:14 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 59/70] misc: samsung: scsc: import 4.14 WLBT core sources
 verbatim

Import, unmodified, the Samsung SCSC (Maxwell / WLBT) core sources needed
for the Exynos 9610 Wi-Fi/Bluetooth chip, as a reference base for the 6.18
forward-port. Source: A50 baseline kernel, branch halium-a50-aa17rf2,
commit 4f37ef39 (Samsung/FreshROMs Mint 4.14.194), driver 11.19.0.18.0,
matching stock firmware S620_E9610_R3-1_Y21W46A.

Scope (M9.1 boundary A): platform_mif_9610 and the mxman core, MIF
ram/mailbox/interrupt/stream transports, firmware file access, logring,
the mx_client_test client (boots the chip with the NULL service, no
Wi-Fi/Bluetooth), plus the headers they include. Nothing is built yet:
Kconfig and Makefile come with the 6.18 adaptation commits.

Change-Id: Ia79da3aeaf83b56de79e146566b03b08e38962c6
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
